#. type: Content of: <sect1><title>
#: lfs-en/prologue/standards.xml
msgid "LFS and Standards"
msgstr "LFS 和标准"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><para>
#: lfs-en/prologue/standards.xml
msgid ""
"The structure of LFS follows Linux standards as closely as possible.  The "
"primary standards are:"
msgstr "LFS 的结构尽可能遵循 Linux 的各项标准。主要的标准有："

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/prologue/standards.xml
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/\"> "
"POSIX.1-2024</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/\"> "
"POSIX.1-2024</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/prologue/standards.xml
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html\"> "
"Filesystem Hierarchy Standard (FHS) Version 3.0</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html\"> "
"Filesystem Hierarchy Standard (FHS) Version 3.0</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><para>
#: lfs-en/prologue/standards.xml
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/lsb.shtml\">Linux Standard "
"Base (LSB) Version 5.0 (2015)</ulink> was intended to ensure that binary "
"software packages can be installed and run on a compliant system but it's "
"defunct now.  Nowadays it's not practical to build a system satisfying the "
"old LSB requirements, and a binary software package is usually shipped in a "
"form containing all the required third-party components (maybe except very "
"basic and conserved ones like glibc, bash, or coreutils), for example a "
"tarball containing all the components, a statically-linked executable, or a "
"lightweight container image like AppImage or Flatpak, instead of relying on "
"LSB if it's intended to be distro agnostic.  LFS editors had used LSB as a "
"reference in the past, but now in the entire LSB only the requirement of the "
"dynamic linker path is seriously considered (in <xref linkend='ch-tools-"
"glibc'/> some symlinks will be created for the requirement)."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/lsb.shtml\">Linux Standard "
"Base (LSB) Version 5.0 (2015)</ulink> 曾试图保证二进制软件包能在任何符合它的"
"系统上安装并运行，但它目前已被废弃。现在实际上已不可能构建能满足 LSB 中陈旧条"
"款的发行版，而且需要在任意发行版运行的二进制软件包发布时通常采取某种包含全部"
"所需第三方组件 (或许排除 glibc、bash、coreutils 之类非常基本且演化保守的组"
"件) 的形式，例如包含全部组件的压缩包、静态链接可执行文件、AppImage 或者 "
"Flatpak 等轻量化容器镜像等，而不是依赖 LSB。LFS 编辑团队曾经参考过 LSB，但现"
"在对于整个 LSB 规范来说只会考虑其规定的动态链接器路径 (在 <xref linkend='ch-"
"tools-glibc'/> 中会为满足此项规定创建一些符号链接)。"
